      ],
      "text": "The 10x CLI supports an interactive session mode, --byok for a user-supplied OpenRouter key, --model <tier>, --resume <name>, and -x to run a prompt and exit."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_994e3a8c1ab4d37d71ea2bb46b8ed17e9ca0912b020bea59bb11da58574108b6",
