        "slc_53b2d6dc8744a00434395bca2d70c068bb64c1cfaf7ec571cd4cee28ffbf0d38"
      ],
      "text": "Superpowers are multi-step AI workflows that chain different models, with each step routed to the fastest model tier able to handle it."
    },
